{"id":15780,"author":"ClubberNugget","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eMap Name: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:20.0pt;\r\nmso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:Chinyen\"\u003eAscent\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eCreator: Random_Guy\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eGamemode: Walls\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eTeams: \u003cspan style=\"color:red\"\u003eRed\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style=\"color:#558ED5;mso-themecolor:text2;mso-themetint:153;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:\r\n#558ED5;mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor:text2;mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha:\r\n100.0%;mso-style-textfill-fill-colortransforms:\u0026quot;lumm=60000 lumo=40000\u0026quot;\"\u003eBlue\u003c/span\u003e,\r\n\u003cspan style=\"color:#00B050\"\u003eGreen\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan style=\"color:yellow\"\u003eYellow\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eHello Everybody,\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eThis is my fifth map submission and my fourth\r\nwalls map, Ascent! This map has an interesting twist thrown in on it, you can\r\nspawn in either two places: the ground or…..in the sky island above the\r\nground!!! Ground has more resources, but don’t worry to those who spawned above\r\nground, there are some nice items up there too, also, there is a nice lake you\r\ncan jump into if you want to meet your ground teammates, but not so fast, if\r\nyou stick in the sky until the walls drop, you’ll see that each sky island is linked\r\nto another and there are items floating in the middle that would be difficult\r\nto get from the ground!\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/qkMrkSd.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/qkMrkSd.png\"\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eThe purpose of this map is to give another\r\ndimension to the gamemode and to provide more roles of duty to each team; it\r\nmay take more than one player for a team to win the match.\u0026nbsp; \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/jY6LbfB.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/jY6LbfB.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eIf you spawn on the ground, don’t feel insignificant,\r\nremember, there are more resources on the ground, you and your teammates in the\r\nsky are equally important in this map.\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/b3Gg6m9.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/b3Gg6m9.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eI almost forgot to say that the map also has\r\na Redstone elevator in the clock tower!\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/4kzwMiK.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/4kzwMiK.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003eI hope this map is found fitting for the\r\nserver and feedback is always appreciated, thanks ^_^\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zuly0m5.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/zuly0m5.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/r761ubbnr6pkpnv/AABxte2Xnc_bv29mxoTQP92Na?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eMap Download and YML\u003c/a\u003e\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:11.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:\u0026quot;Cambria\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;serif\u0026quot;;mso-ascii-theme-font:major-latin;\r\nmso-hansi-theme-font:major-latin\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://imgur.com/a/LGKu4#0\" target=\"_bl